{"ref":"BDB, אֲחִימֶ֫לֶךְ","hw":"אֲחִימֶ֫לֶךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִימֶ֫לֶךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>brother of Melek</em>, Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חמלך</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חמלכת</span>; v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">אחיהו</a> supr.<strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  priest in Saul’s (Dvd’s) time <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.2\">1 S 21:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.14\">22:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.16\">16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֲחִימֶ֑לֶךְ)</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.31\">1 Ch 24:31</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:2\" href=\"/Psalms.52.2\">ψ 52:2</a> (title); son of Ahitub <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.9\">1 S 22:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.11\">11</a>, (cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.12\">12</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.20\">20</a>; father of Abiathar <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.6\">1 S 23:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.7\">30:7</a>; so also <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.17\">2 S 8:17</a> 𝔖 Ew We Th Dr; where MT <span dir=\"rtl\">אחימ׳ בן־אביתר</span>; whence <em>id.</em> wrongly <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.6\">1 Ch 24:6</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.4\">4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֲח׳ מִבְּנֵי אִיתָמָר)</span> & <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.16\">18:16</a> (where read <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲח׳</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲב׳</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Hittite <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.6\">1 S 26:6</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲחִימַ